WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.599
1. Go to Contracts and click Add contract.

2
00:00:02.599 --> 00:00:05.119
2. Type a Title, for example "Linen hire 2027".

3
00:00:05.119 --> 00:00:08.710
3. Choose the Supplier and Category. Supplier not there yet? Click Add new supplier.

4
00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:13.663
4. Add the value, dates and notice period if you know them. Only a title is needed for a draft; the rest is checked when you send it on.

5
00:00:13.663 --> 00:00:16.387
5. Leave Needs Legal review ticked unless Legal has agreed it doesn't need one.

6
00:00:16.387 --> 00:00:22.045
6. Click Save draft. The contract gets its reference, for example JBSAUS0000416.
